title: NetExec SMB Multiple Credential Authentication Attempts
status: experimental
description: Detects NetExec SMB commands using username and password lists to perform multiple authentication attempts against a remote host, which may indicate password spraying or brute-force activity.
    - https://thedfirreport.com/2026/05/11/flash-alert-etherrat-and-tuktuk-c2-end-in-the-gentleman-ransomware/
author: Sümeyra Yüksel
date: 2026/10/21
tags:
    - attack.lateral-movement
    - attack.T1110
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection_cli:
        CommandLine|contains|all:
            - ' smb '
            - '--no-bruteforce'
            - '--continue-on-success'
    condition: selection_cli
fields:
    - Image
    - CommandLine
    - User
level: medium
